    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you deal Sneak Attack damage to a creature, you can deal an additional 3d6 Radiant or Necrotic Damage (your choice).</p><ul><li>If you choose Radiant, one creature you can see within 60 feet regains Hit Points equal to the bonus damage dealt.</li><li>If you choose Necrotic, the target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC or have the Frightened condition until the end of your next turn. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Dexterity Modifier, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</li></ul>"
